Beluga modifies only the Java WebRtcAudioTrack output-lifetime/callback path and
adds PlaybackOutputObserver. All unrelated SDK classes and all original native
library payloads are preserved. Source patch, offline builder, input contract
and provenance instructions are in android/webrtc-adapter in the Beluga source.
The derived AAR also contains META-INF/beluga-webrtc-adapter provenance.

The accompanying LICENSE.webrtc and PATENTS.webrtc reproduce the upstream
notices. They are not a complete inventory of third-party components linked
into the prebuilt native libraries. Complete transitive notice/license and
security review is still required before release distribution.
